              "option_id": "e1_opt_vip",
              "label": "Pour boiling salt water down the drain",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": "Pouring boiling salt water now!",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "The heavy bucket lifts an inch off the tile—pushed from underneath by long pale fingers.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "SECRET UNLOCKED: A wet shriek echoes down the shaft. A gold ring belonging to Ben’s missing brother shoots up onto the tiles.",
